  unitName: "Rutee (6\u2605)"
  unitId: 20545
  unitNumber: 1123
  description: A young woman from another world who became a Swordian Master in command
    of a sentient sword. Although Rutee grew up in an orphanage, she ended up meeting
    both her real father and younger brother during her travels. Unfortunately, they
    died shortly after she learned of their existence, and Rutee moved on with her
    life as if nothing had happened. However, her loyal partner and friend Mary could
    see right through her apparent indifference, and led Rutee to eventually open
    up about her feelings.
  summonDesc: Hmm...<br>Looks like we've been summoned, Atwight. We may have some
    fun with this!
  fusionDesc: Yes! This power will help me<br>make more money!<br>Why do I need so
    much, you ask?<br>Well, that's a secret!
  evoDesc: You pushed me to show you my real self. Well fine! Sit back and watch
    then!
